    Chapter 01 Azad Jammu & Kashmir Statistical Year Book 2023 Introduction
    The projected population of AJ&K in 2022 was 4.389 million while male and female
    proportions were found 2.142 & 2.247 million, respectively. In segregated term, the
    population of AJ&K comprises of 49% male and 51% female i.e. 95 males per 100 females
    whereas almost 100% population is Muslim. The population density of AJ&K presently
    stands at 330 persons per sq.km.

